              "fill": "#70583F",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "In 2014, Lena began with one borrowed bucket, an early train to the flower market and a hand-lettered sign. The shop grew around the same idea: choose beautiful things, then give them room to be themselves.",
